WEBVTT

00:04:29.585 --> 00:04:32.372
our traditional Mongolian
horsehead fiddle.

00:04:33.431 --> 00:04:36.608
In my head, I couldn't believe
it was coming true.

00:04:36.949 --> 00:04:39.599
And the horsehead fiddle
was like a ticket.

00:04:40.104 --> 00:04:43.229
When Mongolians find out
that you can play morin khuur,

00:04:43.253 --> 00:04:45.323
you're instantly respected.

00:04:46.093 --> 00:04:48.205
They say its two strings

00:04:48.229 --> 00:04:50.897
express all the events of the world.

00:04:51.676 --> 00:04:54.951
I ended up staying
with them for nine days,

00:04:54.975 --> 00:04:57.083
and they didn't even ask me to leave.

00:04:57.469 --> 00:04:59.804
I think if I tried
to stay there for two months,

00:04:59.828 --> 00:05:01.309
they would have let me.